  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "我已经喜欢上淳于乔了  (Xin Huimei Confesses Her Feelings)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "wen_simo": "闻思默",
    "xin_huimei": "辛惠美"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "At a discreet restaurant, longtime admirer Wen Simo treats Xin Huimei to dinner and gently asks about her hospital visit, prompting a candid confession from Huimei. Listen to their conversation first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "你觉得他们家菜还合口吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "好吃。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "这儿私密性很好，不会有人来偷拍的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我又不在乎。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "是啊，你一直都不在乎这些。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "可那天去那家医院，你倒是很低调啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我是去看个朋友，不想给别人找麻烦。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "淳于乔这个魔鬼鱼，他是不会怕这种麻烦的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "你好像对很多人都很了解呀。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "圈里人，八九不离十吧，这人我接触过，我不喜欢他。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我已经喜欢上淳于乔了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "你对我的心思我都明白，我现在心里已经有他了。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "你觉得他们家菜还合口吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do the dishes at this place suit your taste?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "好吃。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Delicious.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "这儿私密性很好，不会有人来偷拍的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Privacy here is excellent; nobody will sneak paparazzi photos.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我又不在乎。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I do not care about that anyway.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "是啊，你一直都不在乎这些。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'True, you have never cared about things like that.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "可那天去那家医院，你倒是很低调啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yet the day you went to that hospital, you dressed remarkably low-key.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我是去看个朋友，不想给别人找麻烦。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I went to visit a friend and did not want to cause trouble for someone else.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "淳于乔这个魔鬼鱼，他是不会怕这种麻烦的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'A Manta Ray like Chun Yuqiao would never be afraid of that kind of trouble.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "你好像对很多人都很了解呀。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You seem to know an awful lot about everyone.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "圈里人，八九不离十吧，这人我接触过，我不喜欢他。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'In our circle one hears most things; I have met the man, and I do not care for him.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我已经喜欢上淳于乔了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I have already fallen for Chun Yuqiao.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "你对我的心思我都明白，我现在心里已经有他了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I understand your feelings toward me, yet my heart already holds him now.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
